      "thumburl": "https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/J41_083_Bf_Leipzig_Hbf%2C_Schienenpr%C3%BCfzug.jpg/1280px-J41_083_Bf_Leipzig_Hbf%2C_Schienenpr%C3%BCfzug.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail",
